          <Comment Type="public">NRAS Transcript: NM_002524.5 cDNA Change: c.44G&gt;T Protein Change: p.G15V Mutation Type: Missense synonymous mutation in exon 2, within the GTPase domain and responsible to encode P-loop Genomic Location (GRCh38): chr1:114,716,116G&gt;T Oncogenicity: Oncogenic NRAS c.44G&gt;T (p.G15V) is an oncogenic, somatic mutation which is not previously reported in databases such as COSMIC and ClinVar. No approved NRAS-targeted therapies currently exist for this mutation. It may influence prognosis and inform eligibility for clinical trials targeting downstream pathways.</Comment>
